WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:03.330
I'll tell you about Roya.

00:03.330 --> 00:08.130
The truth is I brought her back
from Tusk ten years ago.

00:09.100 --> 00:12.870
This is my homeland.

00:12.870 --> 00:15.840
I no longer have anywhere to return to.

00:18.450 --> 00:22.750
The whole, great lot of you surrounding
a frail, little girl, eh?

00:24.090 --> 00:27.050
This Tusk lives up to its reputation
as a land of savages.

00:27.820 --> 00:35.560
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:35.560 --> 00:42.530
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:55.880 --> 01:02.090
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

01:02.090 --> 01:09.050
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:09.260 --> 01:15.570
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:15.570 --> 01:22.700
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:25.150 --> 01:32.550
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:32.550 --> 01:38.530
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:38.530 --> 01:46.170
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:46.170 --> 01:53.040
Tooku tooi basho e to

01:59.910 --> 02:03.820
Episode 22
Maze of Memory

02:05.520 --> 02:07.490
Who is this guy?

02:13.090 --> 02:15.890
Now then, what should I do?

02:30.850 --> 02:32.810
His body is...

02:33.950 --> 02:36.850
Could he be a shard caster too?

02:36.850 --> 02:38.820
There'll be no end to them.

02:39.620 --> 02:41.960
We're taking off, girl.

02:41.960 --> 02:43.750
Close your eyes!

02:47.930 --> 02:50.060
My name's Ginga.

02:50.060 --> 02:51.860
Nice to meet you.

02:52.170 --> 02:54.640
What? Whoa, put me down!

03:00.740 --> 03:05.010
King Gari laments that the number
of shard casters taken as

03:05.010 --> 03:07.950
sacrifices recently is woefully lacking.

03:07.950 --> 03:11.990
I believe you gentlemen understand
that at no point

03:11.990 --> 03:14.960
was your comfortable social status
ever promised.

03:16.930 --> 03:21.260
And doesn't that include you, Master Moloch?

03:21.260 --> 03:25.400
As usual, your mouth is the only smart
thing about you, Norman.

03:25.400 --> 03:28.030
And no one is more skilled at putting
his foot in his than you!

03:39.880 --> 03:42.350
What? Shifting, you say?

03:42.350 --> 03:43.550
Yes...

03:43.550 --> 03:46.020
If it's as Gerdieff has predicted...

03:47.390 --> 03:51.460
Does that mean the accursed child
is here in this land?

03:51.460 --> 03:53.700
I shall go see with my own eyes.

03:53.700 --> 03:59.170
Will my daughter still bring me to ruin,
even after all this time?

03:59.170 --> 04:02.140
Roya, you wretched girl!

04:03.500 --> 04:06.800
"My daughter"? Roya, huh?

04:19.920 --> 04:22.220
Thanks for rescuing me earlier.

04:24.730 --> 04:27.000
It's no big deal.

04:27.000 --> 04:32.270
But that was no place for a girl to be
wandering about alone, you know.

04:32.270 --> 04:35.670
And you don't exactly look like a Tuskan either.

04:35.670 --> 04:37.470
What land did you come here from?

04:37.470 --> 04:39.770
That's not any of your business.

04:39.770 --> 04:41.310
You're right!

04:41.310 --> 04:43.610
But the thing is, this is Tusk.

04:43.610 --> 04:46.210
If you wander around all on your lonesome,

04:46.210 --> 04:48.180
you'll be attacked again!

04:50.750 --> 04:52.390
Don't you touch me.

04:52.390 --> 04:54.320
Wh..What the heck?!

04:54.320 --> 04:56.220
I was only joking around!

04:56.220 --> 04:58.530
Well, if you touch me again, you'll pay for it!

04:58.530 --> 05:01.460
All right, sorry.

05:01.460 --> 05:04.260
I need to hurry on ahead.

05:09.200 --> 05:11.470
That's one feisty girl.

05:11.470 --> 05:14.440
I guess that's cute in a way.

05:19.450 --> 05:24.050
Zed, would you bring Roya back to us?

05:24.050 --> 05:29.090
Normally, I would go to Tusk myself, but...

05:29.090 --> 05:33.330
Zico, Roya will not return even if you do go.

05:33.330 --> 05:35.560
Zed will prove far more capable.

05:35.560 --> 05:39.520
She is remarkably open towards Zed.

05:41.970 --> 05:44.470
Sorry, Roya, we'll talk later!

05:44.470 --> 05:46.910
Wait! This is important.

05:46.910 --> 05:48.040
It's very important...

05:48.040 --> 05:50.670
Gotcha, we'll have a good talk later!

05:58.590 --> 06:00.710
I'll bring Roya back.

06:02.820 --> 06:04.990
I'm counting on you, Zed.

06:04.990 --> 06:08.620
That smile of hers is the one
thing I don't want to lose!

06:13.840 --> 06:16.070
Noah, I'm sorry.

06:16.070 --> 06:18.040
Wait a little longer for me.

06:28.120 --> 06:30.990
I was always told that they had died,

06:30.990 --> 06:33.950
but my parents might be alive.

06:37.330 --> 06:38.950
This is...

06:42.460 --> 06:45.430
I should find some answers if I go there.

06:50.540 --> 06:52.340
Was it you?

06:52.910 --> 06:55.710
Are you the one who shifted here from Templar?

06:57.750 --> 06:59.810
Who's there?

06:59.810 --> 07:03.440
You're the girl who was taken as a sacrifice!

07:05.250 --> 07:07.220
Ro..Roya...

07:09.490 --> 07:11.730
She's the one from that time...

07:11.730 --> 07:16.900
I had thought I had seen those unpleasant
eyes somewhere before.

07:16.900 --> 07:19.870
I see, so that's how it is.

07:25.370 --> 07:28.540
Those eyes are exactly as they were long ago!

07:28.540 --> 07:29.610
You...

07:29.610 --> 07:31.410
Do you know me?!

07:34.820 --> 07:37.280
You are supposed to be dead!

07:42.520 --> 07:46.160
I told you you'd be attacked again.

07:46.160 --> 07:48.630
Listen to people's advice, will you?

07:49.930 --> 07:52.570
Bastard, who are you?

07:52.570 --> 07:54.360
A spirit, huh?

07:59.970 --> 08:01.240
What?

08:01.240 --> 08:05.080
That man is hemming my spirit in.

08:05.080 --> 08:09.180
I've never heard tale of a shard
that could do that.

08:09.180 --> 08:11.150
What land has he come from?

08:13.960 --> 08:16.920
Damn, I've encountered quite a nuisance.

08:24.570 --> 08:26.360
It's all right now.

08:27.640 --> 08:29.430
What's going on?

08:30.070 --> 08:34.680
What does she mean "supposed to be dead"?

08:34.680 --> 08:38.300
Does this mean I have no place at all?

08:39.050 --> 08:42.020
What... what am I?

08:45.650 --> 08:48.120
Are you all right, young lady?

08:49.290 --> 08:50.960
Who are you?

08:50.960 --> 08:55.160
I am Norman, and I live here in Tusk.

08:55.160 --> 08:59.290
I would like to invite you to my mansion,
if it pleases you.

09:19.850 --> 09:21.650
Tusk, huh?

09:22.990 --> 09:25.620
Don't do anything stupid, Roya!

09:36.900 --> 09:38.570
I see...

09:38.570 --> 09:43.080
You came to Tusk all alone in order
to find out who you truly are.

09:43.080 --> 09:44.380
Yes...

09:44.380 --> 09:46.580
Do you have anything to go on?

09:46.580 --> 09:49.710
No, nothing to speak of.

09:52.590 --> 09:56.420
You appear to be quite bewildered.

09:56.420 --> 09:58.490
So, how about this?

09:58.490 --> 10:02.460
Why don't I be your guardian?

10:02.460 --> 10:04.090
Guardian?

10:04.900 --> 10:06.370
As you can see,

10:06.370 --> 10:10.440
even in Tusk I am a privileged
member of the elite class.

10:10.440 --> 10:14.240
You may be my adopted daughter
and reside here.

10:15.410 --> 10:16.680
Adopted daughter?

10:16.680 --> 10:22.950
If you are with me, I can make
you known throughout Tusk.

10:22.950 --> 10:25.690
Those who do know you will doubtless appear.

10:25.690 --> 10:28.390
Your adopted daughter?

10:28.390 --> 10:31.660
But why would you extend yourself so far
for someone you don't know?

10:31.660 --> 10:35.560
As you know, Tusk is a savage land.

10:35.560 --> 10:40.520
It must seem especially so to one such as you,
who has come from a peaceful land like Templar.

10:41.370 --> 10:45.540
However, I do not want you to dislike Tusk,

10:45.540 --> 10:51.170
especially not if the very blood of
Tusk flows within you.

10:52.110 --> 10:53.910
Blood of Tusk...

10:55.080 --> 10:59.420
Well, I suppose this is all rather sudden, and
you have not yet sorted out your thoughts.

10:59.420 --> 11:03.160
Take your time and consider my offer,
perhaps over a meal.

11:03.160 --> 11:06.390
This is a very serious matter for you after all.

11:06.390 --> 11:09.690
Yes, thank you very much.

11:17.940 --> 11:20.470
So, Roya was here?

11:20.470 --> 11:23.810
It's just as predicted after all!

11:23.810 --> 11:25.450
So, what happened?

11:25.450 --> 11:27.520
You took care of her, didn't you?!

11:27.520 --> 11:28.580
No...

11:28.580 --> 11:29.880
Why not?!

11:29.880 --> 11:33.420
The girl will bring ruin upon me!

11:33.420 --> 11:37.290
Someone else intervened just as I had her.

11:37.290 --> 11:39.160
My sincere apologies.

11:39.160 --> 11:40.290
Intervened?

11:40.290 --> 11:42.160
Who the hell was it?!

11:42.160 --> 11:45.630
It was someone I had not seen before either.

11:45.630 --> 11:47.830
Who the devil was he?

11:49.870 --> 11:52.770
I'm finished! Finished!

11:52.770 --> 11:55.740
I will eliminate her without fail.

11:55.740 --> 11:58.210
This time for sure.

12:01.920 --> 12:06.250
Find the girl "Roya" who has
come from Templar.

12:06.250 --> 12:08.260
Do it at any cost.

12:08.260 --> 12:10.220
Understood.

12:12.590 --> 12:15.430
I stained these hands with blood

12:15.430 --> 12:18.400
to achieve my current rank.

12:18.400 --> 12:22.530
I will not have that taken away from me now!

12:23.970 --> 12:26.100
Wow, what a feast!

12:28.310 --> 12:31.850
Hey, let me give you some advice.

12:31.850 --> 12:35.480
Go back to Templar, for your own sake.

12:36.750 --> 12:38.720
Hey, are you listening?

12:39.620 --> 12:41.890
I'll still be alone, even if I go back.

12:41.890 --> 12:44.330
I have no aim anyway,

12:44.330 --> 12:48.930
so right now I think it's best to do
what Norman suggested.

12:48.930 --> 12:51.700
He's being kind enough to you now,

12:51.700 --> 12:56.940
but you have no idea what this Norman
guy could be thinking.

12:56.940 --> 12:58.970
Same with you.

12:58.970 --> 13:04.280
Hey, now don't give me that after
I saved your neck twice!

13:06.150 --> 13:07.650
I'm sorry.

13:07.650 --> 13:09.650
Thank you for helping me before.

13:09.650 --> 13:12.450
Hey, sure thing!

13:15.060 --> 13:16.850
Want to eat?

13:23.960 --> 13:26.830
The place is as much of a pain as ever.

13:26.830 --> 13:28.800
I'm in a hurry.

13:28.800 --> 13:31.770
I don't have time to be messing around with you!

14:13.880 --> 14:15.680
Now a Tuskan, huh?

14:27.330 --> 14:30.360
This is no place for you.

14:30.360 --> 14:33.070
Go back to Templar.

14:33.070 --> 14:34.690
What?

14:37.100 --> 14:41.940
Wait! There's someone who shifted here
from Templar before me!

14:41.940 --> 14:43.410
Her name's Roya!

14:43.410 --> 14:45.380
Do you know anything about her?

14:46.150 --> 14:49.920
Why are you looking for that girl?

14:49.920 --> 14:53.350
I have to protect her.

14:53.350 --> 14:56.220
I'll take her back to Templar, safe and sound.

14:56.220 --> 14:59.680
That is why I've come here.

15:02.800 --> 15:06.470
If you head due east, you will come to a mansion.

15:06.470 --> 15:09.170
The girl is there.

15:09.170 --> 15:11.140
Th..Thanks.

15:13.410 --> 15:16.380
Who the heck is that guy?

15:21.580 --> 15:26.040
Indeed, so Roya has agreed to become
my adopted daughter.

15:27.090 --> 15:31.050
The accursed girl, who will bring
ruin unto her father, eh?

15:32.360 --> 15:35.330
I have obtained something most interesting.

15:45.640 --> 15:47.240
That Zed's such a jerk.

15:47.240 --> 15:49.210
Well, excuse me!

15:53.650 --> 15:55.440
Zed?!

15:58.350 --> 16:00.350
Why did you come here?

16:00.350 --> 16:02.920
The old man asked me to.

16:02.920 --> 16:04.490
Oh...

16:04.490 --> 16:06.730
Well, you didn't have to come
if you didn't want to.

16:06.730 --> 16:08.830
Everyone's worried about you.

16:08.830 --> 16:10.100
Let's go back to Templar.

16:10.100 --> 16:12.300
I'm not going back.

16:12.300 --> 16:14.540
What are you so angry about?

16:14.540 --> 16:16.140
I'm not angry.

16:16.140 --> 16:18.040
You didn't have come if you didn't want to!

16:18.040 --> 16:20.340
It's not like I didn't want to.

16:31.150 --> 16:33.020
I'm sorry.

16:33.020 --> 16:36.480
I wouldn't listen to what you had to say.

16:39.690 --> 16:42.430
What's that? I didn't hear you.

16:42.430 --> 16:45.130
Look, I said I'm sorry, all right?!

16:45.130 --> 16:47.870
Is that any kind of attitude to have
if you're trying to apologize?

16:47.870 --> 16:49.840
Oh, just shut up!

16:52.670 --> 16:54.340
Soon...

16:54.340 --> 16:57.240
Soon you will be able to see Roya.

16:57.240 --> 17:01.050
I truly will be able to see her, won't I?

17:01.050 --> 17:02.880
Yes...

17:02.880 --> 17:08.990
All the time I waited in solitude,
believing that she was alive...

17:08.990 --> 17:12.950
Oh, it was such a difficult and lonely time.

17:13.730 --> 17:19.200
But, Cloud, your solitude is what saved me.

17:19.200 --> 17:23.500
And I, too, was saved by your solitude.

17:25.110 --> 17:26.900
Cloud...

17:29.380 --> 17:33.150
So, you don't plan on going
back to Templar, huh?

17:33.150 --> 17:35.620
The old man and everyone else
are waiting for you.

17:38.090 --> 17:42.420
All I ever thought about was becoming stronger,

17:42.420 --> 17:45.760
since I didn't have anything.

17:45.760 --> 17:50.360
But now I've lost sight even of that.

17:50.360 --> 17:54.330
That's exactly why I want to know
more about myself.

17:54.330 --> 17:56.570
I want to know the real me.

17:56.570 --> 18:00.210
But there are some things you're better
off not knowing too, right?

18:00.210 --> 18:02.110
You might be right...

18:02.110 --> 18:04.580
But I want to know!

18:06.680 --> 18:11.520
I want to meet my parents if they're still alive.

18:11.520 --> 18:13.390
Oh, yeah?

18:13.390 --> 18:16.190
Then, do whatever you like.

18:17.760 --> 18:21.930
But I'm concerned, so I'm going to hide out
in this room for a while.

18:21.930 --> 18:23.860
That's not a problem, is it?

18:23.860 --> 18:26.830
No, thanks.

18:34.510 --> 18:37.210
Oh, it's only you, Despara.

18:37.210 --> 18:39.010
Don't startle me like that.

18:39.010 --> 18:41.950
It is time for Norman's party.

18:41.950 --> 18:43.380
Please get ready.

18:43.380 --> 18:44.720
I know that!

18:44.720 --> 18:46.520
I'll head over there now.

18:52.860 --> 18:56.600
Why would he be having a party
now of all times?

18:56.600 --> 19:00.130
Just what is that Norman thinking?

19:00.130 --> 19:03.140
No doubt he simply wants to put on a show.

19:03.140 --> 19:05.040
Petty vanity...

19:05.040 --> 19:07.340
He's an irritating fellow.

19:10.940 --> 19:15.520
There is someone whom I'd like
to introduce to you all.

19:15.520 --> 19:17.810
Please look that way.

19:23.020 --> 19:25.490
Why she's gorgeous!

19:30.530 --> 19:31.530
Roya!

19:31.530 --> 19:33.730
Wh..What did you say?!

19:33.730 --> 19:37.100
What is she doing here?!

19:37.100 --> 19:41.540
This is Roya, who is now my foster-daughter.

19:41.540 --> 19:43.670
I hope you will all become acquainted
with her this evening.

19:44.980 --> 19:46.780
Foster-daughter?

19:48.580 --> 19:50.950
Master Moloch!

19:50.950 --> 19:52.750
It's Roya!

19:53.450 --> 19:55.250
Serves you right...

20:07.100 --> 20:08.640
You must be tired.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.940
Here...

20:09.940 --> 20:11.910
Thank you very much.

20:14.740 --> 20:16.710
Haven't we met...

20:17.840 --> 20:20.470
Your mother awaits you.

20:27.550 --> 20:29.520
Mother...

20:46.010 --> 20:49.460
My mother is beyond this door?

20:58.150 --> 20:59.920
Roya!

20:59.920 --> 21:01.890
Roya, it is you, isn't it?

21:13.100 --> 21:14.730
Roya...

21:16.600 --> 21:19.230
I'm so happy you're still alive.

21:26.580 --> 21:28.380
Mother...

21:31.420 --> 21:33.050
Roya!

21:34.020 --> 21:35.990
Mother...

21:56.710 --> 21:58.180
What's wrong?

21:58.180 --> 21:59.810
Mother!

22:00.250 --> 22:01.920
My head...

22:01.920 --> 22:03.520
It hurts!

22:03.520 --> 22:05.820
Mother, are you all right?

22:16.500 --> 22:18.120
You're...

22:18.670 --> 22:20.460
Roya!

22:21.100 --> 22:23.730
Wh..What's going on?!

22:26.410 --> 22:29.860
This time you will die!

22:41.920 --> 22:44.520
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.520 --> 22:47.360
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.360 --> 22:52.320
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.670 --> 22:58.310
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.310 --> 23:04.270
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.320 --> 23:14.720
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.720 --> 23:18.520
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.230 --> 23:22.960
Kono michi o tobashite

23:22.960 --> 23:30.430
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.100 --> 23:33.770
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.770 --> 23:36.540
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.540 --> 23:41.500
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.020 --> 23:47.550
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.550 --> 23:53.690
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:17.350 --> 24:20.940
Next Time
Bonds

24:18.420 --> 24:20.940


Next time, "Bonds"
